WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:06.453
Hello!

2
00:00:06.851 --> 00:00:08.686
Who are you?

3
00:00:09.545 --> 00:00:12.392
I am a spotted hyena.

4
00:00:13.118 --> 00:00:16.313
We are mammals that live in clans.

5
00:00:16.737 --> 00:00:18.971
Where do you live?

6
00:00:19.271 --> 00:00:21.393
We live in Africa.

7
00:00:22.111 --> 00:00:24.325
We love the savanna.

8
00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:27.470
You look like a dog.

9
00:00:28.114 --> 00:00:30.820
Spotted hyenas are more like cats.

10
00:00:31.524 --> 00:00:33.792
We run fast, and we see well.

11
00:00:34.774 --> 00:00:37.150
That makes us good hunters.

12
00:00:37.915 --> 00:00:39.875
What do you eat?

13
00:00:40.806 --> 00:00:44.248
We hunt wildebeests and antelope with our clans.

14
00:00:45.299 --> 00:00:49.143
Large clans hunt even bigger animals like rhinos.

15
00:00:50.165 --> 00:00:53.196
We also eat other animals' leftovers.

16
00:00:54.079 --> 00:00:56.617
Do you ever hunt alone?

17
00:00:57.340 --> 00:01:00.099
We hunt small prey by ourselves.

18
00:01:01.149 --> 00:01:04.991
We eat the whole animal—even their teeth!

19
00:01:07.345 --> 00:01:11.912
Spotted hyenas make lots of sounds, right?

20
00:01:12.368 --> 00:01:17.077
Yes. We can howl and wail.

21
00:01:17.448 --> 00:01:23.211
We can make a loud laughing sound too.

22
00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:26.627
Do you have any enemies?

23
00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:30.571
Well, lions and hyenas like the same food.

24
00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:34.040
Sometimes lions steal our meals.

25
00:01:35.007 --> 00:01:36.846
They also attack us.

26
00:01:38.076 --> 00:01:40.154
Oh! I see a big lion.

27
00:01:40.736 --> 00:01:43.289
I'll call my clan for help.

28
00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:45.000
Bye!

29
00:01:45.759 --> 00:01:48.591
Good-bye, Spotted Hyena!

